('024de2a9-6acc-43d8-b647-b16b0653c1f4', null, 'public_demo', 0, '# Orbit Notes: Architecture Notes

*Fictional sample document for the public demo. Orbit Notes is not a real product.*

## Overview

Orbit Notes is a web application with three parts: a React frontend, a backend API, and a PostgreSQL database. Notes are stored as plain Markdown text so they can always be exported.

## Technology choices

The frontend uses React with TypeScript. The backend API is written in Node.js. We chose PostgreSQL over a document database because decisions and action items need relational links to notes, people and dates, and because the team already has strong PostgreSQL experience.

## Search design

Search combines two techniques. Keyword search handles exact terms such as names and ticket numbers. Semantic search uses text embeddings so that a question like "why did we drop the calendar feature?" can find a note that never uses the word "drop". Notes are split into chunks of about 300 words before they are embedded.

## Decision extraction

When a note is saved, a background job reads it and proposes decisions and action items. A person must confirm each proposal before it is stored as an official decision. We chose human confirmation because early tests showed that fully automatic extraction made about one mistake in every ten decisions.

## Performance targets

- Opening a note: under 300 milliseconds.
- Search results: under 1.5 seconds for workspaces with up to 10,000 notes.
- Availability target: 99.5 percent per month.

## Security

All data is encrypted in transit and at rest. Each workspace is isolated, and members can only see notes in workspaces they belong to.', '[-0.083174,-0.001201,-0.025159,-0.004252,-0.048069,-0.032753,-0.064842,0.038885,0.017653,-0.040465,0.017174,0.079351,0.024595,-0.034732,-0.048578,-0.070524,-0.052429,-0.026832,0.050427,0.021383,0.012795,-0.010572,-0.001228,-0.002995,0.025537,0.069079,-0.019791,-0.047404,-0.047098,-0.185679,-0.046742,-0.032882,0.061993,-0.011109,0.001578,0.037814,-0.009225,0.017086,-0.021584,0.042511,0.014424,0.02974,0.002375,0.04995,0.043666,-0.040447,-0.02515,-0.032232,-0.047435,0.023097,-0.048775,-0.020539,-0.047067,0.038938,0.036714,0.013249,0.054449,0.027516,-0.020499,0.02077,0.031702,-0.046434,-0.119896,0.099982,0.001749,0.029752,-0.053805,-0.009043,-0.013979,0.003091,-0.000963,0.041879,-0.018295,0.050038,0.039094,-0.017326,-0.001835,-0.004339,0.043966,-0.061307,-0.01947,-0.054906,-0.021603,0.041114,-0.007912,-0.037216,-0.020771,0.050155,0.044108,-0.003581,0.036938,-0.038873,0.004909,0.026113,0.000187,0.006142,-0.015465,0.026142,-0.011915,0.394802,-0.041755,0.016205,0.036253,0.018078,-0.006334,-0.031813,0.054574,-0.055882,-0.002353,-0.027184,0.022876,0.007911,0.024973,-0.044868,0.011423,-0.029921,0.042465,-0.000664,0.000097,-0.045105,-0.006498,0.039338,0.024978,0.076772,0.052012,0.02867,0.035876,0.00687,0.011819,0.04068,0.050736,0.056858,-0.037321,-0.013636,0.019983,0.039471,0.037443,-0.052069,0.011309,0.023343,-0.014861,0.030405,0.036869,-0.021876,-0.073823,0.158996,0.066296,0.050977,-0.054045,0.003239,-0.016267,0.075817,0.024429,0.005002,-0.019227,0.014599,0.017689,0.001046,-0.062662,-0.008774,-0.028538,0.017203,-0.048514,0.09086,-0.008517,-0.150758,-0.0553,0.035761,-0.0047,-0.039442,-0.010984,0.005063,-0.011164,-0.028171,0.05881,0.007487,0.037235,-0.030139,0.070143,-0.002834,0.017921,-0.013114,-0.043219,0.010165,-0.0339,0.006898,-0.072221,-0.022879,0.055976,0.006383,-0.038876,0.002309,0.002472,0.045582,-0.057814,-0.052084,0.030847,-0.04875