('024de2a9-6acc-43d8-b647-b16b0653c1f4', null, 'public_demo', 1, 'All data is encrypted in transit and at rest. Each workspace is isolated, and members can only see notes in workspaces they belong to. Notes are never used to train external models.

## Known limitations

Search quality drops for very short notes with little context. Extraction accuracy is lower for notes that are not written in English.

## Data model

The database has five main tables: workspaces, members, notes, decisions and action items. A decision links to the note it came from, the people involved and a date. An action item links to a note, an owner and a due date. Deleting a note marks its decisions as "source removed" instead of deleting them, so the decision history is never silently lost.

## Environments and deployment

There are three environments: development, staging and production. Every change goes through a pull request with at least one reviewer and automated tests. Changes deploy to staging first, and a release to production happens only after the staging checks pass. Production releases happen on Tuesdays and Thursdays, never on Fridays.

Database changes are made with versioned migrations. Every migration must have a tested rollback before it is approved.

## Monitoring and alerts

The team tracks error rate, search latency and extraction job failures. An alert goes to the on-call engineer when the error rate stays above 2 percent for five minutes, or when search takes longer than 3 seconds for more than 5 percent of requests. The on-call rotation changes weekly among four engineers.', '[-0.047451,0.000783,0.015646,0.000661,0.032731,-0.04286,-0.07106,-0.046649,0.029947,-0.024905,0.059416,0.051879,0.00489,-0.033333,-0.077561,-0.029032,-0.042717,-0.054342,0.049215,-0.010916,0.014137,-0.031146,0.004229,0.026282,0.026289,0.05534,-0.001123,-0.03118,-0.061371,-0.221601,-0.046915,0.019278,0.040447,0.031588,0.052939,0.053839,-0.001825,-0.015359,-0.012248,0.018443,0.027299,0.07193,-0.007018,-0.025621,0.004582,-0.034146,0.000252,-0.011352,-0.01565,0.031355,-0.008253,-0.005551,-0.039811,0.081944,0.021489,-0.011703,0.100041,0.060612,-0.026144,-0.002941,0.039954,-0.026247,-0.123905,0.061444,0.009351,0.036028,-0.032829,-0.098483,-0.000143,-0.008143,-0.019847,-0.012196,-0.046493,0.05928,0.032495,-0.009883,-0.011801,0.052735,0.0093,-0.018419,-0.01068,-0.078004,-0.026393,0.029671,-0.016023,0.018655,-0.001706,0.010644,-0.011722,-0.025535,-0.032634,0.001834,0.028198,0.037095,-0.025154,-0.01473,0.004795,0.021791,-0.025865,0.419295,0.008859,-0.010134,-0.00816,0.025654,-0.052253,-0.016952,-0.018533,-0.028834,-0.00759,-0.013857,-0.001028,0.019572,0.02462,-0.019564,-0.006658,-0.00396,0.00809,0.007519,-0.005436,-0.00989,-0.03116,0.032213,0.040066,0.030349,0.025018,0.027278,0.032165,0.0206,0.041414,-0.015099,0.0348,-0.005622,-0.103001,-0.006965,-0.036052,0.005183,0.030585,0.002304,-0.009051,0.012738,0.011718,0.05972,0.045205,-0.030965,-0.085365,0.173625,0.03095,0.057478,-0.026422,-0.06466,-0.012063,0.049717,0.040649,-0.024542,0.012669,0.019344,-0.009553,-0.002442,-0.106258,-0.009689,0.004355,-0.012557,-0.034668,0.141822,0.0077,-0.060117,-0.043499,0.036428,0.042073,-0.004958,0.00103,-0.012829,0.006295,0.000666,-0.023157,-0.058391,0.016059,0.00713,0.006534,0.011626,0.001