('024de2a9-6acc-43d8-b647-b16b0653c1f4', null, 'public_demo', 2, 'An alert goes to the on-call engineer when the error rate stays above 2 percent for five minutes, or when search takes longer than 3 seconds for more than 5 percent of requests. The on-call rotation changes weekly among four engineers.

## Cost estimate

For the private beta with 20 teams, the estimated monthly infrastructure cost is about 600 dollars: roughly 250 dollars for the database, 150 dollars for application servers, 120 dollars for embeddings and language model usage, and 80 dollars for monitoring and backups. The cost per active member is expected to fall as usage grows.

## Backups and recovery

The database is backed up every night and retained for 30 days. The recovery goal is to restore service within 4 hours and to lose no more than 24 hours of data.', '[-0.07458,-0.014367,-0.014692,-0.049415,0.002693,-0.015729,-0.054545,0.018092,0.000832,-0.029957,0.045884,0.043054,0.042388,-0.013683,0.020435,0.027546,0.015045,-0.062474,0.073921,0.057272,0.013333,-0.134046,-0.009681,-0.031697,-0.025025,0.058095,-0.043855,0.005723,-0.074842,-0.175724,0.00569,-0.020874,0.072855,0.006732,0.044115,0.06512,-0.000493,-0.016497,0.003134,0.036303,0.009493,0.05681,-0.056101,-0.004692,0.027423,-0.058221,-0.038038,-0.033932,-0.020975,0.032815,0.017194,0.00521,-0.031647,0.024993,0.003195,-0.003424,0.059605,0.089136,0.006644,0.021438,0.000482,-0.029131,-0.100185,0.028889,-0.029063,0.039655,-0.001653,-0.065599,0.059728,0.029195,0.004233,0.044554,0.024037,-0.013408,0.057935,0.007831,-0.010463,0.047751,0.057843,0.010146,0.01391,-0.024864,0.018863,0.026378,0.001013,-0.034706,0.081954,0.073543,0.003601,0.004741,0.003424,0.050556,0.034896,0.001552,-0.046305,0.027356,-0.053935,0.032207,-0.064796,0.395569,0.039221,0.026853,-0.035737,-0.012754,-0.004754,-0.072103,-0.006941,0.010078,-0.022669,0.02292,-0.050071,0.012126,0.041904,-0.046535,0.008461,0.041514,-0.011153,-0.042389,-0.035414,-0.01054,-0.000263,0.011088,0.077848,0.023168,-0.012769,0.033407,0.034071,0.098009,0.037432,0.086216,0.02362,-0.037997,-0.053953,0.00624,0.0688,-0.024638,0.02948,-0.010059,-0.007511,0.028834,-0.008207,-0.051347,0.028153,-0.005903,-0.075248,0.118959,-0.006898,0.013002,0.033067,-0.109385,-0.001361,0.009134,0.060951,-0.014127,-0.009173,-0.037672,0.026359,-0.008558,-0.097118,0.023998,-0.019451,-0.013586,-0.015913,0.083503,0.028212,-0.077519,-0.011875,0.013472,-0.002626,-0.022377,-0.054644,0.032541,0.048364,-0.039568,0.05701,-0.025631,-0.01515,-0.009472,0.038431,0.015263,0.011203,0.020104,-0.012864,0.008803,-0.031709,-0.070079,-0.04699,0.001287,0.013509,-0.03287,-0.090783,0.012883,-0.039308,0.015499,0.001616,-0.0329