('9fb1692b-e26a-4cc7-ab50-493f03353429', null, 'public_demo', 1, 'Marcus reported that the engineering budget for the quarter is 90,000 dollars, of which 61,000 dollars has been spent. The largest remaining cost is the language model usage for decision extraction. Priya asked for a cap of 1,500 dollars per month for beta usage. The team agreed on the cap and on a weekly report of actual usage.

## Customer feedback summary

Tom summarised feedback from the 12 teams that tried the early prototype:

- Ten teams liked the plain-language search and described it as "the part that feels like magic".
- Seven teams wanted a calendar integration, which is why the decision to postpone it was discussed at length.
- Five teams found the extracted decisions too detailed, and asked for shorter summaries.
- Three teams asked for a way to export all notes, which is already planned.

## Hiring

The team will open one new engineering role in October, focused on search quality. The role will report to Marcus. Elena asked to add a part-time contractor for illustration work during the launch period, and Priya agreed to review the budget before approving it.

## Open questions

- Should the free plan include search, or only note taking? No decision was made.
- Should decision summaries be shortened by default? Elena will test two versions with the beta teams.', '[-0.073382,0.014855,-0.011219,-0.062012,-0.011991,-0.008268,-0.060907,0.048376,0.003837,0.015646,0.038681,0.000567,0.013899,0.041097,0.007733,-0.019364,-0.024587,-0.108392,0.077479,0.035664,0.030059,-0.078089,0.008377,-0.02753,0.038717,0.018031,-0.042632,-0.05507,-0.050355,-0.228792,0.000132,0.025598,0.057376,0.001899,0.001048,0.067705,0.030447,-0.038568,-0.000887,0.006367,-0.006911,0.04695,-0.042091,0.005395,0.031824,0.005429,-0.010296,-0.035701,-0.038142,0.04168,-0.009038,-0.032589,-0.008051,0.002085,-0.019674,0.04926,0.031415,0.036263,0.016229,0.016996,0.015219,-0.043482,-0.156089,0.053232,-0.030388,0.033088,-0.035304,-0.022438,0.025566,0.058941,0.015568,0.011885,0.033829,-0.007767,0.019661,0.034769,0.017842,0.045002,0.063138,-0.023349,-0.046643,0.000782,-0.012131,-0.012371,-0.015339,-0.002718,0.026983,0.059307,0.022192,-0.068554,0.047128,-0.014631,0.012879,-0.01142,-0.068567,0.034703,0.023189,-0.025813,-0.063813,0.482371,0.041386,0.01632,0.014866,-0.04536,0.016049,-0.04843,0.036921,-0.029742,0.003115,-0.014876,-0.019983,0.022016,0.088509,-0.040784,-0.00086,0.030401,-0.02318,-0.038362,-0.026983,-0.065454,0.00739,-0.006067,0.045151,0.006589,-0.0377,0.000499,0.053121,0.06602,-0.000652,0.056606,0.055968,-0.004882,-0.065412,0.010529,0.001297,-0.029543,0.020723,-0.031456,0.04445,-0.011614,-0.059922,0.047908,0.006379,-0.057554,-0.108742,0.118214,0.028349,-0.017266,0.061243,-0.022104,0.019744,0.062373,0.079814,-0.022614,-0.006903,-0.00545,0.045226,0.02815,-0.098393,0.061423,0.006612,-0.009906,-0.004067,0.048722,0.009235,-0.090237,-0.056489,0.008333,-0.028257,0.005308,-0.044887,0.004867,0.024648,0.002739,0.021687,-0.013878,-0.010591,-0.01797,0.025087,0.028834,0.021056,0.043897,-0.008306,0.012627,-0.061382,-0.06267,-0.02837,-0.029693,-0.004669,0.021762,-0.052788,0.018572,-0.031156,0.096701,-0.007242,-0.032647,0.022902,0.006731,-0.034623,0.000275,-0.001004,0.000615,-0.