('584c599b-f430-45f3-9bfa-f5837f750573', null, 'public_demo', 0, '# Orbit Notes: Product Brief

*Fictional sample document for the public demo. Orbit Notes is not a real product.*

## Problem

Small teams keep meeting notes, decisions and action items in many places: chat threads, personal notebooks and shared drives. When someone asks "what did we decide about pricing?", nobody can find the answer quickly, and people end up repeating discussions.

## Target users

Orbit Notes is for project leads and product managers on teams of 5 to 30 people. They run several meetings a week and need a reliable record of decisions that the whole team can search.

## Product vision

Orbit Notes captures meeting notes in a simple editor, automatically extracts decisions and action items, and lets anyone search them in plain language. The goal is that a new team member can find the reason behind any past decision in under one minute.

## MVP scope

The first release includes:

- A Markdown note editor with meeting templates.
- Automatic extraction of decisions and action items.
- Plain-language search across all notes in a workspace.
- Sharing a workspace with up to 30 members.

## Out of scope for the MVP

- Calendar integrations.
- A mobile app.
- Audio recording and transcription.
- Custom roles and permissions.

## Pricing

The team plan costs 8 dollars per member per month. A free plan covers one workspace with up to 5 members and 100 notes.

## Timeline

The private beta is planned for October. Public launch is planned for January.

## Customer research findings

We interviewed 24 project leads between March and May. Nineteen of them said they lose track of decisions at least once a month. Fourteen said the biggest cost is repeating a discussion that already happened.', '[-0.101071,0.022597,0.0045,-0.043614,-0.032694,-0.019117,-0.035146,0.038192,-0.012868,-0.027591,0.085692,0.055743,0.017848,-0.016343,-0.031712,-0.064241,-0.008433,-0.095645,0.063736,0.047526,-0.001822,-0.043,-0.022336,0.014689,0.033632,0.053554,-0.009669,-0.05113,-0.044294,-0.19421,-0.019533,0.039103,0.072829,0.000466,-0.019971,0.062644,-0.014185,-0.006163,0.00509,0.016447,0.017555,0.026788,-0.035797,0.028199,0.007246,-0.019061,0.000706,-0.062555,-0.051362,0.013365,-0.042842,-0.024267,-0.031198,0.02412,-0.014188,0.009395,0.005349,0.012978,0.019517,0.023734,0.013213,-0.078659,-0.133931,0.085218,-0.048091,0.031808,-0.044922,-0.002204,-0.012157,0.033259,0.038402,0.050567,0.005859,0.026937,0.023713,-0.008388,0.010233,0.017704,0.029353,-0.066119,-0.044898,0.022819,-0.043015,0.030953,0.010048,0.005854,0.042917,0.055047,0.069567,-0.039983,0.043926,-0.004807,-0.001935,-0.008777,-0.048088,0.015855,0.009873,-0.012767,-0.078409,0.438653,-0.008867,0.045736,0.055953,-0.010133,-0.025877,-0.035498,0.024489,-0.052613,-0.00363,0.037735,0.030219,0.048762,0.048607,-0.0473,0.020814,0.029756,0.031675,-0.016341,0.024677,-0.063456,0.001953,0.040894,0.059991,0.035421,-0.039765,0.036873,0.016357,0.051121,0.035735,0.031822,0.094698,0.011872,-0.054409,0.008915,0.027277,0.000455,0.012517,-0.025173,0.019044,0.017844,-0.004212,0.068617,0.034243,-0.059034,-0.079558,0.16775,0.065633,0.001669,-0.022958,-0.032582,0.009062,0.042288,0.010654,0.002481,0.015604,-0.000192,0.04389,-0.007234,-0.129539,0.044502,-0.001298,0.024569,-0.070439,0.071179,0.016307,-0.167494,-0.037095,0.005462,-0.003434,0.002931,-0.054804,-0.00081,0.015181,-0.028975,0.024823,0.020469,0.036524,-0.013013,-0.006546,-0.013162,0.012963,0.004212,-0.040234,-0.013233,-0.035542,-0.032406,-0.068426,-0.027461,-0.005086,0.020381,-0.064