## Risks

- People may not trust automatic extraction, which is why a person confirms each decision.
- Teams with strong existing habits may not switch. The free plan lowers the cost of trying.
- Search quality depends on note quality, and very short notes give little to search.', '[-0.060341,-0.012768,-0.033799,0.003749,-0.008246,-0.041314,0.028255,-0.018889,0.016602,-0.053702,0.04609,0.10226,0.035524,-0.047663,-0.038472,-0.014431,-0.033533,-0.083755,0.029152,0.05188,0.01874,0.045977,-0.020703,-0.010797,0.007984,0.03388,-0.01458,-0.065507,-0.033596,-0.200816,-0.009763,0.026518,0.048411,-0.005483,0.002081,0.047821,0.018946,0.036052,0.012366,0.012571,-0.007031,0.017822,-0.008628,-0.013302,-0.000589,0.01328,0.052043,-0.06469,-0.006546,0.049509,0.01115,0.017488,-0.017372,0.030792,-0.005823,0.028722,0.061514,0.032369,-0.054505,0.047791,0.010593,-0.025902,-0.119598,0.089767,-0.036267,0.055135,-0.052414,0.031161,-0.028472,0.064583,-0.017154,0.023444,-0.034951,0.041908,-0.000152,-0.007436,-0.016302,0.024236,-0.021924,-0.015383,-0.059102,0.021468,0.017448,0.040755,-0.044684,0.002118,0.020264,-0.008627,0.071363,-0.069996,0.07464,0.011659,-0.047238,0.016882,-0.031458,0.013866,-0.009566,0.052324,-0.047684,0.386516,-0.037751,0.04295,-0.022545,-0.03206,0.015476,-0.050113,0.017848,-0.045713,0.003435,-0.027663,0.028879,0.008889,0.031131,-0.038701,-0.013146,0.059058,0.025533,-0.041073,0.022884,-0.0257,-0.040443,0.008678,0.065874,0.042442,-0.00346,0.057931,0.039349,0.072682,0.041513,-0.009867,0.054375,-0.069071,-0.034582,0.019623,0.031702,-0.010384,-0.031558,-0.00367,0.014051,0.022427,0.019876,0.073914,0.024911,-0.040026,-0.03854,0.168313,0.004084,0.024288,-0.00985,-0.084554,0.002341,0.021975,0.013525,-0.058905,0.017504,0.006492,0.025345,-0.028064,-0.038497,-0.009379,-0.012296,-0.021126,-0.055595,0.060888,0.023135,-0.040807,-0.029115,-0.046551,-0.013577,-0.027347,-0.027028,-0.016057,0.00774,0.003823,0.009725,0.019525,-0.032467,-0.048202,0.019216,-0.021214,-0.001609,0.049271,0.012782,0.033281,-0.007579,-0.032175,-0.055758,-0.011789,0.064119,0.086572,-0.030023,0.020171,0.001413,0.041968,-0.120945,-0.037449,-0.057402,-0.025521,-0.0372,0.009674,-0.040092,-0.019347,-0.018233,-0